      "period": 0,
      "nation": "赵",
      "line": 4603,
      "text": "Hmm, hmm. Let me reconsider once more whether conquest could work: We have a 1500 gold start and others similar. Actually do we know others' gold? Probably similar ~1500. So no edge. Conquest: we'd need to attack 7 nations, each with 5+ tiles, army, and they'd fight back (and possibly call 野人? no). Not feasible. Also AI may be scripted to cooperate via 周."
